theorem k215UnpairAt3830Step9Z (a b c: nat): $ k215PStep (k215UnpairAt3830State k215PNum3830 a b 0 c) = (k215UnpairAt3830State k215PNum3838 a b 0 c) $ = '(eqtr (eqtr (k215PAtCD k215PLookupUnpair3830_3830) (ifeq (eqeq1 k215PGet2_vector) eqid eqid)) (ifpos eqid));

