theorem k215UnpairAt3830Step11S (a b n c: nat): $ k215PStep (k215UnpairAt3830State k215PNum3832 (suc a) b n c) = (k215UnpairAt3830State k215PNum3833 a b n c) $ = '(eqtr (eqtr (eqtr (k215PAtCD k215PLookupUnpair3830_3832) (ifeq (eqeq1 k215PGet6_vector) eqid eqid)) (ifneg peano1)) (k215PStateeq2 (eqtr (k215PSeteq2 (subeq1 k215PGet6_vector)) (eqtr k215PSet6_vector (k215PVectoreq7 (eqtr subSS sub02))))));

