theorem k215UnpairAt3830AdvanceZero (b n c: nat): $ k215PReach (k215UnpairAt3830State k215PNum3830 0 b (suc n) c) (k215UnpairAt3830State k215PNum3830 (fst (suc (0, b))) (snd (suc (0, b))) n c) $ =
 '(mpbi (k215PReacheq2 (k215UnpairAt3830Stateeq eqid (eqtr (eqcom fstpr) (fsteq k215PairDiagonal_rotate)) (eqtr (eqcom sndpr) (sndeq k215PairDiagonal_rotate)) eqid eqid)) k215UnpairAt3830CycleZero);

